 "description": "Yao2008_Rb_E2F_Switch\nBioModels BIOMD0000000318 (curated). SBML file: BIOMD0000000318_url.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 100 time units (SED-ML: BIOMD0000000318_url.sedml (auto-generated placeholder); duration chosen from the dynamics: settled), sampling 0.1.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 4.42e-06 of species peak (worst: EF)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] r7 term 1/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] r7 term 2/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] r9 term 1/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] r9 term 2/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] r10: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] time event(s) on 'S' encoded as time/value pairs in EV_P_S.TXT (SET)\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): p_S = S",
